WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.380
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.480 --> 00:04.040
Your breath is precious to many others who still see your worth.

3
00:04.120 --> 00:07.640
Don't let just a few people destroy your life.

4
00:07.920 --> 00:09.520
Just wait and see! I'm going to report you

5
00:09.520 --> 00:11.360
to the Medical Council for being cruel to a patient.

6
00:11.360 --> 00:12.920
You're unfit to be a doctor!

7
00:13.120 --> 00:14.680
I can be a lot crueler than this.

8
00:14.880 --> 00:15.760
Want to find out?

9
00:16.360 --> 00:19.200
I’m really glad to see you again.

10
00:19.400 --> 00:21.160
And don't you see me as a friend?

11
00:21.360 --> 00:22.320
Just a friend?

12
02:30.040 --> 02:31.760
Ms. Kie...

13
02:32.500 --> 02:33.840
Ms. Kie...

14
02:35.150 --> 02:37.950
Oh wow... How much did she eat?!

15
02:40.840 --> 02:42.100
Ms. Kie!

16
02:43.030 --> 02:44.200
Ms. Kie!

17
02:54.440 --> 02:57.000
Huh... she didn't even take her phone with her.

18
02:58.140 --> 02:59.520
Where on earth did she go? Ms. Kie!

19
03:01.110 --> 03:02.280
Ms. Kie!

20
03:03.650 --> 03:05.120
Ms. Kie!

21
03:16.560 --> 03:17.560
Ms. Kie!

22
03:44.240 --> 03:45.530
Ms. Kie!

23
03:46.200 --> 03:48.579
Ms. Kie! Where did she go?

24
03:50.310 --> 03:51.340
Ms. Kie...

25
03:53.940 --> 03:56.600
If I can't find her, am I going to get my salary docked?

26
03:57.420 --> 03:59.020
Oh my, I’m in real trouble now!

27
04:00.730 --> 04:01.230
Let's do it

28
04:01.860 --> 04:03.150
Ms. Kie!

29
04:03.870 --> 04:05.610
Ms. Kie!

30
04:08.100 --> 04:09.000
Ms. Kie!

31
04:11.960 --> 04:12.720
Ms. Kie!

32
04:16.339 --> 04:16.980
Ms. Kie!

33
04:29.900 --> 04:30.710
Ms. Kie!

34
04:46.150 --> 04:47.020
Ms. Kie!

35
04:48.420 --> 04:49.220
Ms. Kie!

36
04:50.880 --> 04:51.590
Ms. Kie!

37
04:54.170 --> 04:56.400
Gosh, where did she disappear to? Ms. Kie!

38
04:57.100 --> 04:58.060
Ms. Kie!

39
05:01.230 --> 05:02.170
Wait, is that Ms. Kie over there?

40
05:05.610 --> 05:08.520
Wow! Out with a new girl?!I have to snap a picture of this!

41
05:09.440 --> 05:11.640
Hold on a sec, let me open the camera...

42
05:11.670 --> 05:14.400
All right, here we go. This spot is perfect!

43
05:21.650 --> 05:22.140
Ms. Kie!

44
05:23.420 --> 05:24.120
Ms. Kie!

45
05:31.500 --> 05:33.200
Help! Someone's drowning!

46
05:35.409 --> 05:36.450
Is Ms. Kie drowning?

47
05:36.900 --> 05:39.180
I’m here to help you!

48
05:40.530 --> 05:41.470
Ms. Kie..

49
07:03.780 --> 07:05.860
The doctor has already finished the examination, Ms. Vodka.

50
07:11.860 --> 07:12.690
Water...

51
07:14.570 --> 07:15.560
Oh, she just woke up!

52
07:15.590 --> 07:16.580
Let me call you back.

53
07:24.660 --> 07:25.590
Bring me water.

54
07:31.300 --> 07:32.530
Bring it to me.

55
07:53.980 --> 07:55.170
What's wrong?

56
07:57.000 --> 07:59.490
You tried to end your life.

57
08:00.360 --> 08:03.680
Why would you commit suicide over something so minor?

58
08:04.430 --> 08:06.650
Your life is worth so much more than that.

59
08:06.980 --> 08:08.150
Stop talking nonsense.

60
08:09.060 --> 08:10.240
I wasn't trying to kill myself.

61
08:13.220 --> 08:15.040
But you were a second away from it!

62
08:15.360 --> 08:17.820
If that woman hadn't stepped in to save you,

63
08:18.450 --> 08:21.580
I’d be in your mourning right now…

64
08:23.240 --> 08:24.730
and I don't want that.

65
08:27.070 --> 08:28.220
Who saved me?

66
09:57.030 --> 09:58.200
How are you feeling?

67
10:00.280 --> 10:01.960
I’m… feeling better now.

68
10:07.920 --> 10:09.030
Thank you

69
10:10.590 --> 10:11.870
for saving my life.

70
10:21.790 --> 10:25.730
Is there something on your mind?

71
10:27.520 --> 10:29.060
You can speak freely, I won't get angry.

72
10:33.220 --> 10:37.020
Well… I might have misunderstood,

73
10:39.320 --> 10:41.760
but when I saw you walking into the sea.

74
10:43.760 --> 10:45.640
I thought you were trying to hurt yourself.

75
10:50.640 --> 10:51.900
I wasn't trying to end my life.

76
10:55.240 --> 10:59.960
Are you saying you just went for a dip and got swept away by a wave?

77
11:01.140 --> 11:01.840
Yes.

78
11:04.140 --> 11:06.040
Even though I shouted your name

79
11:06.560 --> 11:08.040
and you didn’t even turn around?

80
11:10.380 --> 11:11.690
I just didn't hear you.

81
11:12.420 --> 11:13.800
I couldn't hear a single thing.

82
11:16.360 --> 11:17.290
Okay.

83
11:17.720 --> 11:21.170
But common sense tells us that when someone is drowning,

84
11:21.460 --> 11:22.960
they fight to survive.

85
11:23.530 --> 11:27.440
Unless... they meant to drown.

86
11:35.910 --> 11:39.840
I... was drunk.

87
11:40.600 --> 11:45.470
I just drank a bit too much.

88
11:49.720 --> 11:52.190
Thank you for finally admitting it.

89
11:58.940 --> 12:00.640
I've admitted it.

90
12:01.260 --> 12:02.480
So...

91
12:05.140 --> 12:07.010
Can I please repay you, okay?

92
12:14.130 --> 12:15.010
Please,

93
12:15.980 --> 12:16.780
please,

94
12:17.420 --> 12:18.460
please?

95
12:19.650 --> 12:20.140
please.

96
12:25.200 --> 12:26.200
Fine,

97
12:26.640 --> 12:27.680
I’ve given up.

98
12:28.860 --> 12:31.910
But it can't exceed 100 baht, Deal?

99
12:35.140 --> 12:35.820
Deal.

100
12:39.060 --> 12:40.090
You promise?

101
12:43.820 --> 12:44.650
I promised.

102
12:50.650 --> 12:51.900
You can hurt,

103
12:52.700 --> 12:54.000
You can cry.

104
12:55.520 --> 12:57.040
but please don't hurt yourself.

105
13:01.660 --> 13:08.960
Your breath is precious to many others who still see your worth.

106
13:14.640 --> 13:19.720
Don't let just a few people destroy your life.

107
13:23.780 --> 13:24.310
Yes.

108
14:00.940 --> 14:03.640
Oh... has Ms. Pim already left, Ms. Kie?

109
14:04.860 --> 14:05.680
She's gone.

110
14:08.390 --> 14:09.600
But it's good that she left anyway.

111
14:10.900 --> 14:13.550
Who on earth acts like that at her age,

112
14:14.790 --> 14:15.920
nagging like an old aunt.

113
14:16.800 --> 14:20.550
Well... she was just nagging a little bit.

114
14:20.880 --> 14:22.920
if Khun Pim hadn't saved you,

115
14:22.950 --> 14:25.490
you'd probably be dead by now.

116
14:26.010 --> 14:28.810
At first, I thought you were flirting with her,

117
14:28.840 --> 14:30.390
so I raised my phone to take a video.

118
14:30.700 --> 14:32.390
I didn't think you were actually going to drown.

119
14:34.360 --> 14:35.260
What are you taking pictures of, Nuan?

120
14:41.130 --> 14:42.020
Nuannaree.

121
14:46.020 --> 14:47.580
Deduct one thousand.

122
14:50.620 --> 14:52.620
Deduct ten thousand.

123
15:01.570 --> 15:02.420
Ten thousand, huh?

124
15:10.140 --> 15:11.060
Hand it over.

125
15:12.030 --> 15:13.260
Yes, ten thousand.

126
15:36.500 --> 15:37.070
What?

127
15:38.290 --> 15:39.430
Please return my phone.

128
15:40.490 --> 15:41.300
No way.

129
15:42.420 --> 15:45.410
Ms. Kie, please give my phone back.

130
15:45.440 --> 15:47.180
Please, I'm begging you.

131
15:47.410 --> 15:49.790
For what you did, almost getting me killed

132
15:49.820 --> 15:51.350
and then pulling a stunt like recording a video like this?

133
15:53.690 --> 15:55.190
Ms. Kie,

134
15:55.580 --> 15:57.500
Ms. Kie,

135
15:57.530 --> 16:00.070
I'm begging you, please.

136
16:00.670 --> 16:01.530
No way.

137
16:02.080 --> 16:03.530
You might leak this video.

138
16:05.160 --> 16:08.260
Ms. Kie, please give my phone back.

139
16:08.300 --> 16:09.140
I really can't live without it.

140
16:09.160 --> 16:10.430
I swear I'll jump into the sea!

141
16:10.450 --> 16:11.260
Fine.

142
16:12.280 --> 16:13.710
Take my card to buy a new one,

143
16:14.540 --> 16:15.590
and then go get to work.

144
16:17.400 --> 16:18.520
In that case, take it!

145
16:18.540 --> 16:20.520
I'm giving it to you, Ms. Kie!

146
16:21.540 --> 16:24.280
By the way, what do you want me to do?

147
16:27.490 --> 16:28.780
Go look into Ms. Pim's background.

148
16:30.580 --> 16:33.850
Oh, the fling?

149
16:34.270 --> 16:35.350
Right on it!

150
17:03.350 --> 17:06.410
A patient jumped down from the second floor and got injured, Doctor.

151
17:06.740 --> 17:08.410
Have they been sent for an X-ray yet?

152
17:08.650 --> 17:09.859
The patient refuses.

153
17:16.450 --> 17:17.740
Hello, P'Siva.

154
17:18.210 --> 17:20.270
What's wrong with your younger sibling?

155
17:21.150 --> 17:22.480
Are you blind?

156
17:25.849 --> 17:26.579
Mira...

157
17:27.079 --> 17:30.030
well, this is my younger sibling I used to tell you about.

158
17:30.990 --> 17:33.050
She fell from the second floor.

159
17:34.680 --> 17:36.190
I want to change hospitals.

160
17:37.420 --> 17:37.980
Mira.

161
17:39.250 --> 17:40.400
Can the doctor examine my younger sister, please?

162
17:43.060 --> 17:43.520
Ouch!

163
17:49.150 --> 17:50.650
Her anklebone is likely fractured.

164
17:51.630 --> 17:52.770
Send her for an X-ray.

165
17:52.790 --> 17:53.180
Yes.

166
17:53.910 --> 17:56.560
If you already know my anklebone is fractured, just treat it!

167
17:56.590 --> 17:57.860
Why bother with an X-ray?

168
18:00.250 --> 18:01.210
Mira.

169
18:02.280 --> 18:03.070
What?

170
18:03.340 --> 18:05.070
Or is it because you think someone else is more important than me?

171
18:09.900 --> 18:11.340
Such an attention-seeker.

172
18:11.890 --> 18:14.620
That fall probably wasn't even an accident.

173
18:15.130 --> 18:16.960
You just wanted to get attention, didn't you?

174
18:17.660 --> 18:19.050
This is my family's business!

175
18:19.290 --> 18:21.630
Your job is just to treat patients, so do your job!

176
18:22.990 --> 18:23.920
Fine, then.

177
18:24.420 --> 18:26.930
But the patient must sign a consent form stating she won’t hold us liable

178
18:26.960 --> 18:28.930
if the treatment results in a deformed leg.

179
18:29.530 --> 18:32.390
And after that... who knows?

180
18:32.840 --> 18:36.080
Your Brother would probably be so ashamed to have a little sister like you.

181
18:39.250 --> 18:41.340
Go get the consent form for the patient to sign.

182
18:41.520 --> 18:42.000
Yes.

183
18:45.610 --> 18:47.010
Is there something wrong with you?

184
18:51.400 --> 18:53.210
Fine, X-ray then.

185
18:55.040 --> 18:56.530
You should’ve just done that from the beginning.

186
18:57.860 --> 18:59.280
Send the patient for an X-ray, please.

187
18:59.640 --> 18:59.960
Yes.

188
19:11.620 --> 19:13.300
The treatment went well.

189
19:13.780 --> 19:15.180
Since your ankle is fractured,

190
19:15.490 --> 19:17.260
you’ll need to wear a soft cast for about five weeks,

191
19:17.280 --> 19:18.610
and it should heal up nicely.

192
19:19.210 --> 19:22.810
After the cast comes off, you might need some additional physical therapy.

193
19:24.610 --> 19:27.710
Once the medication wears off, it’s going to hurt a bit.

194
19:28.280 --> 19:30.600
so please bear with it, patient.

195
19:32.530 --> 19:33.420
If you were a good doctor,

196
19:33.450 --> 19:34.960
you wouldn't let your patients suffer in the first place.

197
19:36.610 --> 19:39.480
P’Siva, this doctor isn't skillful at all.

198
19:39.520 --> 19:40.950
I want to transfer to another hospital.

199
19:41.370 --> 19:44.080
Mira, apologize to the doctor right now.

200
19:49.140 --> 19:50.520
I’m so sorry on behalf of my sister.

201
19:51.980 --> 19:52.940
It's alright.

202
19:53.680 --> 19:56.100
If there’s nothing else, I’ll take my leave.

203
20:08.200 --> 20:10.200
That doctor is your ex, isn’t she?

204
20:12.460 --> 20:13.360
No.

205
20:14.720 --> 20:16.040
Don’t lie to me.

206
20:16.300 --> 20:17.780
You and that woman were pretty close.

207
20:18.080 --> 20:20.030
Not to mention the way you were looking at her.

208
20:20.840 --> 20:21.680
I don't believe you.

209
20:21.700 --> 20:22.780
Seriously.

210
20:23.000 --> 20:26.140
I actually asked her to be my girlfriend three times,

211
20:26.630 --> 20:28.020
but she turned me down every single time.

212
20:30.920 --> 20:31.840
Really?

213
20:32.610 --> 20:34.630
Yeah… Go to sleep now.

214
20:38.580 --> 20:42.880
Good thing that doctor is blind, then.

215
21:13.520 --> 21:16.630
What are you doing here so early, Ms. Kie?

216
21:19.680 --> 21:21.680
Compensation can't exceed one hundred baht.

217
21:22.640 --> 21:23.900
Would you like a bowl of congee?

218
21:55.060 --> 21:56.120
Let's eat together!

219
21:57.940 --> 21:59.460
I went out of my way to buy this for you,

220
22:00.080 --> 22:01.930
but since you take such good care of me,

221
22:02.910 --> 22:04.350
how can I ever repay you?

222
22:08.010 --> 22:10.200
I'm not expecting anything in return anyway.

223
22:12.120 --> 22:14.620
Just having someone to share breakfast with .

224
22:15.220 --> 22:17.220
It is enough happiness for me.

225
22:25.350 --> 22:26.120
I'd better eat quickly.

226
22:33.570 --> 22:34.360
Aren't you going to eat?

227
22:35.160 --> 22:36.250
Try some first.

228
22:41.900 --> 22:42.740
How is it?

229
22:45.280 --> 22:46.080
It's delicious.

230
22:47.640 --> 22:49.010
Where did you buy this?

231
22:51.060 --> 22:53.060
If I said I made it myself,

232
22:56.280 --> 22:57.410
would you believe me?

233
23:01.410 --> 23:02.360
You're so talented.

234
23:05.320 --> 23:06.560
You're so easy to fool.

235
23:08.560 --> 23:10.010
I actually bought it from my regular spot.

236
23:10.930 --> 23:12.040
Do you like it?

237
23:14.880 --> 23:15.730
I do.

238
23:30.250 --> 23:31.820
You can call me

239
23:32.670 --> 23:35.630
Whiskey or just Kie.

240
23:37.630 --> 23:38.930
Um…

241
23:41.400 --> 23:45.040
Whis.. Ms. Kie.

242
23:48.380 --> 23:50.620
Since you call me that,

243
23:52.270 --> 23:55.850
I’ll get back at you by calling you Ms. Pim too.

244
24:01.730 --> 24:07.070
But wait… I heard you say that just having a dining friend would be nice.

245
24:08.230 --> 24:12.360
So, would it be okay if I came to eat with you every day?

246
24:17.180 --> 24:20.640
Wait… would your boyfriend mind?

247
24:25.440 --> 24:26.520
I'm single.

248
24:31.400 --> 24:32.540
Then….

249
24:34.940 --> 24:38.250
If you want to come have breakfast with me every day,

250
24:40.140 --> 24:41.620
I don't mind at all.

251
24:43.240 --> 24:44.410
Just one thing,

252
24:45.780 --> 24:46.860
don't buy anything to bring here again.

253
24:47.940 --> 24:49.260
I'll make it for you myself.

254
24:50.530 --> 24:53.840
You gave me permission, so let's promise, okay?

255
24:56.990 --> 24:57.980
I promise.

256
25:16.440 --> 25:17.450
Get out!

257
25:23.720 --> 25:25.320
You've already thrown everything you could.

258
25:26.140 --> 25:27.520
Are you going to let me treat you now or not?

259
25:28.220 --> 25:29.160
I'm not going.

260
25:29.680 --> 25:30.690
Don't be difficult.

261
25:31.000 --> 25:32.690
I'm not as kind as your brother.

262
25:33.220 --> 25:34.860
Are you going to go for treatment nicely,

263
25:35.180 --> 25:39.360
or should I call the nurses to tie you up and drag you there?

264
25:41.040 --> 25:43.740
Just wait and see! I'm going to report you

265
25:43.780 --> 25:45.660
to the Medical Council for being cruel to a patient.

266
25:45.710 --> 25:47.240
You're unfit to be a doctor!

267
25:57.100 --> 25:58.070
What are you doing?

268
26:10.840 --> 26:12.410
I can be a lot crueler than this.

269
26:13.070 --> 26:14.060
Want to find out?

270
26:16.560 --> 26:17.190
No.

271
26:19.640 --> 26:20.500
Good.

272
26:49.660 --> 26:52.930
I honestly never thought anyone would actually be able to tame Mira.

273
26:54.280 --> 26:57.280
Don't you think you've been spoiling her a bit too much, P’Siva?

274
26:58.000 --> 26:59.530
I suppose I have.

275
27:00.170 --> 27:03.050
Our parents passed away when she was very young,

276
27:03.580 --> 27:05.930
and with a ten-year age gap between us,

277
27:07.330 --> 27:09.050
I haven't had much time to look after her.

278
27:09.260 --> 27:11.410
I mostly just spoil her with money.

279
27:12.220 --> 27:14.100
I must apologize on Mira's behalf.

280
27:14.810 --> 27:17.820
Hearing this makes me start to feel sorry for that stubborn girl.

281
27:19.070 --> 27:21.730
As for her, if she doesn't cause any more trouble,

282
27:22.000 --> 27:23.210
I won't scold her.

283
27:23.930 --> 27:24.360
Um

284
27:40.280 --> 27:41.100
I'm finished.

285
27:41.330 --> 27:42.510
I want to go back to my room.

286
27:46.740 --> 27:47.070
Siva, you should go.

287
27:47.070 --> 27:50.520
Go ahead, before that stubborn girl causes another scene.

288
28:09.910 --> 28:11.820
How will you be getting back, Pim?

289
28:11.860 --> 28:13.130
I'll call a ride to pick me up.

290
28:14.360 --> 28:16.360
Is that the car you called?

291
28:18.360 --> 28:19.760
Excuse me, I'll be taking my leave now.

292
29:07.320 --> 29:08.590
Did you come to pick me up?

293
29:09.440 --> 29:12.160
No, I just happened to be passing by.

294
30:34.340 --> 30:35.200
Ms. Nuan

295
30:35.800 --> 30:37.060
Oh, yes?

296
30:37.100 --> 30:38.480
I brought the clothes back.

297
30:39.500 --> 30:40.320
Thank you.

298
30:41.520 --> 30:42.610
And where is Ms. Kie?

299
30:43.820 --> 30:46.200
Over there, by the pool.

300
30:46.610 --> 30:48.830
She only just recovered from a hangover two days ago,

301
30:48.850 --> 30:50.090
and she's already back to drinking again.

302
31:32.620 --> 31:34.090
May I sit with you?

303
31:48.960 --> 31:50.120
Please stop drinking.

304
31:54.120 --> 31:57.330
Who do you think you are to order me around?

305
32:02.000 --> 32:03.770
And don't you see me as a friend?

306
32:12.460 --> 32:13.420
Just a friend?

307
32:24.160 --> 32:24.880
Let go of me !

308
32:24.920 --> 32:25.600
No, I won't.

309
32:26.170 --> 32:26.660
Let go of me.

310
32:26.680 --> 32:27.270
No.

311
32:27.310 --> 32:27.690
Let me go.

312
32:30.610 --> 32:32.740
Ms. Kie, I'm sorry.

313
32:33.400 --> 32:34.630
I didn't mean to.

314
32:52.480 --> 32:53.650
Ms. Kie,

315
32:54.770 --> 32:55.760
please let me go.

316
32:58.600 --> 33:00.600
Just a moment ago, you said you wouldn't let go, didn't you?

317
33:06.660 --> 33:10.520
And why are you blushing?

318
33:18.190 --> 33:23.400
Or have you never been hugged by anyone before?

319
33:31.930 --> 33:33.320
I am so happy

320
33:34.840 --> 33:36.840
to be the very first person to hug Ms. Pim.

321
33:42.570 --> 33:44.300
Ms. Kie, you are very drunk.

322
33:45.180 --> 33:46.300
Please let me go.

323
33:49.600 --> 33:50.860
I really am drunk.

324
34:37.659 --> 34:39.060
I'll take my leave and head home now.

325
35:35.620 --> 35:37.660
Stop overthinking right now, Pim!

326
36:05.170 --> 36:06.110
Hello.

327
36:08.540 --> 36:09.700
Have you reached home yet?

328
36:12.270 --> 36:13.520
I'm home now.

329
36:17.480 --> 36:18.520
Ms. Pim…

330
36:19.760 --> 36:20.320
Yes?

331
36:21.800 --> 36:26.180
Were you angry with me just now, Ms. Pim?

332
36:28.690 --> 36:30.690
No, I wasn't angry.

333
36:38.140 --> 36:39.640
What’s wrong with you, Ms. Kie?

334
36:41.220 --> 36:42.660
But I'm angry with myself

335
36:43.920 --> 36:45.400
for making you feel uncomfortable.

336
36:50.100 --> 36:51.310
I won't drink anymore.

337
36:53.040 --> 36:54.490
If you don't want me to drink,

338
36:56.040 --> 36:57.240
I won't drink.

339
37:06.800 --> 37:08.760
It's for your own health.

340
37:12.600 --> 37:13.870
It's for you, actually.

341
37:19.890 --> 37:20.920
Good night.

342
37:22.600 --> 37:23.610
See you tomorrow.

343
37:25.040 --> 37:26.510
Good night to you too, Ms. Kie

344
38:06.650 --> 38:08.060
Dad, when did you get here?

345
38:09.400 --> 38:10.930
I've been here since early evening,

346
38:11.460 --> 38:13.570
And where have you been, huh?

347
38:13.610 --> 38:14.740
Coming home so late at night.

348
38:17.000 --> 38:18.490
I went to a friend's house.

349
38:19.750 --> 38:21.500
Her home is right near ours.

350
38:35.610 --> 38:38.630
Wow, all dressed up so nicely first thing in the morning!

351
38:38.650 --> 38:40.040
Are you going to see Ms. Pim?

352
38:40.070 --> 38:40.620
Mind your own business.

353
38:40.920 --> 38:42.500
Go get your work done.

354
38:43.500 --> 38:45.390
Yes, boss.

355
38:45.430 --> 38:47.520
Don't forget my bonus, okay?

356
38:48.860 --> 38:49.710
If I get a bonus, then...

357
38:51.070 --> 38:51.920
Go back to sleep

358
38:59.070 --> 39:00.230
Ms. Pim...

359
39:00.870 --> 39:02.430
I bought something for you.

360
39:03.340 --> 39:04.290
Ms. Pim?

361
39:13.870 --> 39:15.060
How did you get here?

362
39:16.290 --> 39:16.980
Is that Kie?

363
39:20.130 --> 39:21.650
Breakfast is ready.

364
39:29.770 --> 39:32.090
Please come have breakfast together, Ms. Kie

365
39:33.420 --> 39:34.170
Are you this lonely,

366
39:34.540 --> 39:38.000
wanting a dining companion so badly that you've lowered your standards this much?

367
39:40.760 --> 39:41.620
Ms. Kie..

368
39:42.310 --> 39:43.870
Last night you acted all shy,

369
39:44.850 --> 39:47.130
but now you're clinging to a man's arm.

370
39:48.060 --> 39:49.890
Did you forget the act you put on yesterday?

371
39:51.080 --> 39:54.420
Or have you already slept together,

372
39:55.320 --> 39:56.730
so you don't need to pretend anymore?

373
39:58.670 --> 40:00.610
You act better than a super star.

374
40:02.480 --> 40:03.900
Please listen to me first, Ms. Kie.

375
40:04.480 --> 40:05.180
What?

376
40:05.800 --> 40:06.760
What are you going to lie about this time?

377
40:08.200 --> 40:08.720
You..

378
40:10.460 --> 40:11.210
What?

379
40:12.930 --> 40:14.110
Did I hit a nerve?

380
40:14.780 --> 40:15.830
Hey..

381
40:16.310 --> 40:19.410
If you're going to be someone's mistress, at least have some standards.

382
40:20.770 --> 40:22.790
don't just grab some random old geezer.

383
40:26.640 --> 40:29.990
Ms. Kie, please get out of my house.

384
40:30.010 --> 40:31.880
And stop bad-mouthing me once and for all.

385
40:33.800 --> 40:36.850
Does someone like you have the right to speak?

386
40:38.030 --> 40:39.830
As if extorting money from my mom wasn't enough,

387
40:40.290 --> 40:41.970
you went and tore my family apart.

388
40:42.480 --> 40:45.430
Low-class behavior like this really suits you guys, doesn't it?

389
40:47.430 --> 40:48.350
Pim, go inside the house.

390
40:54.830 --> 40:57.200
Insult me all you want, I don't care,

391
40:57.690 --> 40:59.690
but you have no right to insult my father.

392
41:05.040 --> 41:05.720
Dad.. ?

393
41:06.820 --> 41:08.420
Get out of my house right now!

394
41:11.540 --> 41:12.770
Pim, go inside first,

395
41:12.970 --> 41:14.010
I will follow you shortly.

396
41:18.600 --> 41:22.860
Ms. Kie, you should go home and cool off a bit.

397
41:25.060 --> 41:26.000
Excuse me.

398
41:39.130 --> 41:42.250
Oh, Ms. Kee! Why are you back so soon?

399
41:42.920 --> 41:44.510
What were you up to?

400
41:44.530 --> 41:46.090
Why is your cheek so red like that?

401
41:50.320 --> 41:51.210
Mind your own business.

402
41:52.090 --> 41:53.300
Go pack my bags.

403
41:53.340 --> 41:54.410
I will be heading back to Bangkok.

404
41:55.290 --> 41:56.270
Ms. Kie...

405
41:58.500 --> 42:01.660
But didn't you just leave to see Ms. Pim this morning?

406
42:04.050 --> 42:05.230
What happened to you?

407
42:07.310 --> 42:08.390
Alright, fine, I won't butt in, sis.

408
42:11.360 --> 42:14.150
I knew she was vicious,

409
42:15.670 --> 42:17.850
but I didn't think she would be this vicious.

410
42:20.940 --> 42:22.170
I'm so sorry, Dad,

411
42:23.440 --> 42:25.850
for causing you to get sworn at like that.

412
42:28.360 --> 42:29.310
It's completely fine, dear.

413
42:29.700 --> 42:31.810
She has misunderstood me for a long time.

414
42:32.720 --> 42:34.370
Don't let it weigh on you, okay?

415
42:37.260 --> 42:38.010
Yes.

416
42:40.520 --> 42:41.850
And are you holding up?

417
42:42.070 --> 42:44.450
You still have to meet with the finance company's representative.

418
42:48.040 --> 42:48.860
I'm holding up.

419
42:50.080 --> 42:51.840
I'll just put on heavy makeup.

420
42:52.960 --> 42:54.330
and I'll be okay.

421
42:55.960 --> 42:57.370
Well, my strong girl.

422
43:01.460 --> 43:02.510
Try not to overthink it.

423
43:21.840 --> 43:24.530
Hello, I'm Pim from the PM Anti-Aging Company.

424
43:32.960 --> 43:33.650
Excuse me?

425
44:02.260 --> 44:03.110
Ms. Pim.

426
44:07.300 --> 44:08.550
Hello, Ms. Kaew.

427
44:20.790 --> 44:22.640
You’re so impressive, Khun Pim.

428
44:23.370 --> 44:25.370
Once I’ve gathered all the documents,

429
44:26.590 --> 44:28.710
I’ll contact you again.

430
44:29.990 --> 44:31.370
You’re very capable as well, Khun Kaew.

431
44:31.750 --> 44:34.570
There are still many things I need to do more homework on.

432
44:35.720 --> 44:37.890
If you need any additional documents,

433
44:37.930 --> 44:39.720
please feel free to reach out to me directly.

434
44:45.880 --> 44:46.630
Sure,

435
44:47.730 --> 44:51.070
I’m really glad to see you again.

436
44:51.980 --> 44:55.070
and even happier that we get to work together this time.

437
44:56.060 --> 44:58.340
If there's anything you need help with,

438
44:58.700 --> 45:01.150
you can reach me using the business card I gave you.

439
45:09.200 --> 45:12.470
I’m happy to be working with you too, Ms. Kaew.

440
45:29.390 --> 45:32.700
Are you feeling alright, Ms. Pim?

441
45:34.130 --> 45:35.580
You look a bit tired.

442
45:36.870 --> 45:38.570
If anything's on your mind, you can always talk to me.

443
45:46.090 --> 45:47.030
I'm fine, thank you.

444
45:47.400 --> 45:48.650
I guess I'm just a little tired.

445
45:50.010 --> 45:51.160
Please excuse me.

446
46:39.130 --> 46:41.850
P'Kie, I thought you said you were coming back next week.

447
46:42.400 --> 46:43.480
Why are you back early?

448
46:44.650 --> 46:47.290
Vod, are you in a rush to go to the hospital?

449
46:47.990 --> 46:50.480
I don't have any check-ups or shifts today,

450
46:50.520 --> 46:53.250
but I was worried about the kids, so I thought I'd pop in to check on them.

451
46:54.280 --> 46:55.330
Is something wrong?

452
46:58.080 --> 47:02.100
In that case, can I ask for your advice on something?

453
47:05.080 --> 47:07.550
You insulted her father right in front of her,

454
47:07.890 --> 47:09.610
getting slapped is the least of what you deserved.

455
47:11.440 --> 47:14.360
Well, how was I supposed to know Mr. Phong was his dad?

456
47:15.800 --> 47:18.510
Besides, that Mr. Phong did a horrible thing to our family, too.

457
47:20.360 --> 47:22.810
So after telling me all this,

458
47:23.360 --> 47:24.450
what is it that you actually want?

459
47:28.940 --> 47:30.180
From my perspective,

460
47:30.900 --> 47:33.770
things like this are actually fine. There's no need to overthink it.

461
47:34.490 --> 47:37.440
Just don't get involved with each other outside of business.

462
47:38.600 --> 47:40.740
Unless...

463
47:44.650 --> 47:45.350
But what?

464
47:46.340 --> 47:47.500
You're going to fall for her, aren't you?

465
47:53.680 --> 47:55.940
Have you already fallen for her?

466
47:58.840 --> 48:01.300
Yeah, I did.

467
48:02.300 --> 48:04.470
Well, then you have two choices.

468
48:05.340 --> 48:07.340
One, go apologize to her.

469
48:09.440 --> 48:10.310
And what's the second?

470
48:11.700 --> 48:13.450
Or else, it's over between you two.

471
48:16.980 --> 48:18.300
But ending things is probably for the best anyway.

472
48:19.150 --> 48:21.670
That guy only brings discord to our family.

473
48:22.940 --> 48:25.740
If we stayed together, we'd probably just end up fighting all the time.

474
48:26.930 --> 48:28.530
Where on earth did you get an idea like that?

475
48:31.300 --> 48:32.400
Dad.

476
48:46.400 --> 48:47.800
Wait, why did it have your name?

477
48:47.980 --> 48:49.070
It wasn't Mom's?

478
48:50.240 --> 48:51.250
What’s so strange about that?

479
48:51.980 --> 48:53.630
We run a hospital business,

480
48:54.050 --> 48:55.550
and Phong is a celebrity.

481
48:56.140 --> 48:57.970
Partnering up in an anti-aging business is

482
48:58.680 --> 48:59.670
a win-win for everyone.

483
49:01.280 --> 49:04.120
Ah, so this is what makes you think Phong

484
49:04.820 --> 49:06.530
is coming to break our family apart, huh?

485
49:09.170 --> 49:12.420
I’ve known Phong since back when he was dating your mom.

486
49:13.480 --> 49:15.630
But those two couldn't make it work,

487
49:16.710 --> 49:18.010
so I went ahead and pursued your mom.

488
49:18.490 --> 49:19.950
Then she started dating me

489
49:20.370 --> 49:21.940
until we had the three of you kids.

490
49:22.320 --> 49:25.540
Your mom knows full well that things wouldn't have worked out between her and Phong.

491
49:26.360 --> 49:29.450
Besides, when they broke up, neither of them felt any lingering regrets at all.

492
49:31.040 --> 49:33.270
But Mom still hangs out with that guy anyway.

493
49:33.670 --> 49:36.050
Well... they stay in touch as old friends,

494
49:36.570 --> 49:38.970
plus they’re business partners.

495
49:40.120 --> 49:43.890
You really have quite an overactive imagination, don't you? Huh?!

496
49:44.970 --> 49:47.750
Then back when Mom and Dad started sleeping in separate rooms,

497
49:48.270 --> 49:49.830
wasn't it because of a fight over Mr. Phong?

498
49:51.770 --> 49:54.110
Well, once I became the hospital director,

499
49:54.380 --> 49:57.290
I started getting off work late and keeping irregular hours.

500
49:58.070 --> 50:00.790
And your mom had to keep waking up throughout the night.

501
50:01.520 --> 50:04.510
So we talked it over and agreed to sleep in separate rooms.

502
50:05.790 --> 50:07.180
That's all there was to it.

503
50:07.600 --> 50:11.990
So Mom and Dad didn't fight?

504
50:12.500 --> 50:15.050
Yeah... We still love each other just as much as ever.

505
50:16.360 --> 50:19.430
Your mom has told you plenty of times that Phong is not involved with this,

506
50:20.060 --> 50:21.370
but you just wouldn't listen.

507
50:26.060 --> 50:27.070
Then...

508
50:29.060 --> 50:30.700
What should I do, Dad?

509
50:34.040 --> 50:35.640
Vod, help me out.

510
50:39.300 --> 50:40.360
You're my child.

511
50:41.280 --> 50:42.530
If you're brave enough to do it, be brave enough to face the consequences.

512
50:58.620 --> 50:59.780
Hold on a second, Dad.

513
51:00.660 --> 51:01.330
What that, dear?

514
51:02.120 --> 51:03.270
I forgot something.

515
51:03.470 --> 51:04.440
I'll be right back, okay?

516
51:04.790 --> 51:06.690
Hey wait, let me get you an umbrella.

517
51:06.730 --> 51:07.350
No, it's fine, Dad.

518
51:07.390 --> 51:08.330
Just wait here a moment.

519
51:08.350 --> 51:09.590
I'll be back real quick, just a second.

520
51:09.620 --> 51:10.210
Wait up, dear!

521
51:10.230 --> 51:10.760
Just a second, just a second.

522
51:10.790 --> 51:11.590
I'll be right back!
